# Epic Trading PLC — environment variables
#
# Every variable below is OPTIONAL. The enquiry API (src/app/api/enquiry)
# validates submissions, generates a reference number, and logs every
# enquiry to the server console regardless of whether these are set. Email
# delivery via Resend is skipped (not faked) until both are configured.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development, or add these under
# Vercel → Project Settings → Environment Variables for production.
# Never commit a real .env file.

# --- Resend (sales notification + customer confirmation emails) -------------
RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=
SALES_TEAM_EMAIL=
